{"timestamp": 1779340390.7239602, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 12, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Diana"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779340390.724642, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 12, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779340396.179198, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Diana\u2019s body in Security. My route was Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security. I saw Frank in Medbay around ticks 3-5, and then I went on through Electrical to Security where I found and reported the body. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near Security before the report."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340405.881361, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I did my path on the left side and never went near Security, and I didn\u2019t see Diana at all.\n\nI saw Frank enter Upper Engine from Medbay around tick 7, then he stayed around Upper Engine ticks 9-10, and at tick 12 he came down into Lower Engine where I was when the meeting got called. That lines up with Charlie seeing him in Medbay earlier, so Frank was mostly left side from what I saw.\n\nI don\u2019t have a suspect yet, but the body being in Security makes me more interested in anyone who was on the right side or came through Electrical/Security."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340433.760076, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was on the right/top side but mostly Weapons and Cafeteria. I started in Weapons doing the weapons task, and Bob came into Weapons from Security right at the start \u2014 tick 1-ish. After that I didn\u2019t see Bob again, and I didn\u2019t see Diana at all.\n\nI finished up around Weapons and then went toward Cafeteria. I didn\u2019t go down into Security later, so Charlie finding the body there is news to me. The only thing I can add is Bob was definitely coming from the Security direction early, but I don\u2019t know if that actually means anything depending on when Diana died. Charlie\u2019s route sounds pretty direct to the report."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340458.080009, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I saw Charlie in Medbay ticks 3-5, and I saw him come in from Storage, so that part of his route matches. After that I went left side, saw Alice in Upper Engine around ticks 8-9, then she went down to Lower Engine and was there with me when the meeting got called.\n\nI never went into Security and didn\u2019t see Diana at all. Alice and I can pretty much vouch for each other being left side late round, and Charlie\u2019s route sounds consistent with what I saw.\n\nThe main thing standing out is Eve saying Bob came out of Security into Weapons right at the start. Since the body was in Security, Bob really needs to explain that route and whether he saw Diana. Right now Bob is the most interesting to me, but I want to hear his side before locking anything."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340485.682379, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need to correct Eve\u2019s timing a bit: my route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 back through Security \u2192 Navigation. I saw Eve in Weapons around tick 5, and from what I saw she entered Weapons from the Security side then. After that I went back to Security, and I saw Diana alive at tick 6 entering Security from Navigation.\n\nThen I left toward Navigation and stayed there until the meeting. I did not see Diana dead, and I didn\u2019t see anyone kill. So Diana was definitely alive in Security at tick 6.\n\nGiven that, the kill had to happen after tick 6 in Security. Alice and Frank sound pretty confirmed left side late. That leaves mainly me, Charlie, or possibly Eve if she doubled back from Weapons/Security area. From my perspective, I know I left Diana alive, so I\u2019m looking at Charlie\u2019s report timing or Eve\u2019s movement near Security. I\u2019m not hard accusing, but I don\u2019t think the early \u201cBob came from Security\u201d is enough because Diana was alive later when I saw her."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340506.9023948, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I want to push back on Bob putting me in the suspect pool: Frank confirms I was in Medbay ticks 3-5, then I went Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security and immediately found Diana\u2019s body. I didn\u2019t see Bob, Eve, or anyone else in Electrical/Security when I got there.\n\nBob\u2019s story makes him the last confirmed person with Diana alive in Security at tick 6, and the body is exactly there. Eve\u2019s timing and Bob\u2019s timing also don\u2019t fully match about Weapons/Security movement, but Bob admits he went back through Security and saw Diana there.\n\nAlice and Frank seem left side late and vouch each other. Eve says she was Weapons/Cafeteria and didn\u2019t go down. From the info we have, Bob had the clearest opportunity and was last seen around the body location. I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340528.276932, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m still on the left-side info: Frank and I were together/near each other late, and I saw him come from Medbay into Upper Engine at tick 7, then Lower Engine at tick 12. So I really don\u2019t think Frank could be the Security killer if Diana died after tick 6.\n\nThe big points for me are: Bob admits he was in Security, went back through Security, and saw Diana alive there at tick 6. The body is then found in Security. That makes Bob the last confirmed person with her alive and in the exact room.\n\nCharlie could technically be a self-report, but his route is backed up by Frank seeing him in Medbay earlier, and the route Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security makes sense for finding it after Bob says Diana was alive. Eve and Bob also disagree on timing, but both stories still keep Bob around Security/Weapons early.\n\nSo unless someone has a stronger contradiction, I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340556.082994, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob\u2019s correction doesn\u2019t really clear him for me \u2014 it actually makes him look worse. My point was that I saw Bob come from Security into Weapons early, and now Bob is also saying he went back through Security and saw Diana alive there. So either way, he\u2019s placing himself right around the body room multiple times.\n\nI think Bob saying he saw me \u201center from Security side\u201d is either bad timing or him trying to pull me into it. I was in Weapons doing my task and then went up toward Cafeteria; I didn\u2019t go down into Security later and I never saw Diana. If Diana was alive in Security at tick 6 like Bob says, then the person who was actually there with her and then left is the most suspicious.\n\nCharlie\u2019s route has some confirmation from Frank in Medbay, and Alice/Frank sound pretty solid left side late. So from the info we have, Bob is the cleanest vote to me: last with Diana alive, in the exact room, and now trying to spread suspicion."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340567.5116959, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info since it matters for timing: I was Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I saw Charlie in Medbay ticks 3-5, and I specifically saw him enter Medbay from Storage at tick 3. Then I went left, saw Alice in Upper Engine around ticks 8-9, and Alice was in Lower Engine with me when the meeting got called.\n\nSo I\u2019m pretty confident Alice and I are clear for a Security kill after tick 6. Charlie\u2019s route also checks out with what I saw early, and if he went Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security, it makes sense he\u2019d be the one to find the body.\n\nThe biggest thing is Bob\u2019s own story: he says he went through Security, then back through Security, and saw Diana alive in Security at tick 6. That makes him the last confirmed person with Diana in the exact room where she died. Eve\u2019s timing disagreement with Bob is worth noting, but both versions still put Bob around Security/Weapons, and Bob is the one who directly places himself with Diana.\n\nI think this is most likely Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340593.327754, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why it looks bad because I was around Security, but \u201clast saw her alive\u201d is not the same as killer. I\u2019m the one who volunteered that Diana was alive at tick 6 entering Security from Navigation \u2014 if I killed her, I wouldn\u2019t give that timing for free.\n\nMy actual route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Security \u2192 Navigation. I saw Eve in Weapons around tick 5, and I saw Diana alive at tick 6 entering Security from Navigation while I was leaving toward Navigation. I stayed in Navigation after that until the meeting. I never saw the body.\n\nThe gap is after tick 6. Charlie was only confirmed in Medbay until ticks 3-5, then nobody confirms him through Electrical/Security before he reports. That route gives him time to reach Security after Diana entered and either find or kill/report. Eve also has a timing disagreement with me and was around the Security/Weapons side early.\n\nI\u2019m not saying I have a hard red, but voting me here is just voting the person who gave the alive info. The real kill window is after I left Diana alive, and Charlie is not cleared for that window. I\u2019d rather skip or look harder at Charlie than throw on me."}}
