{"timestamp": 1779340899.28387, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I found Alice\u2019s body in storage and reported immediately. My route was cafeteria -> oxygen -> upper engine -> lower engine -> storage. I saw Charlie in medbay early around ticks 3-5. I saw Alice alive in upper engine around ticks 8-9, then again in lower engine around tick 12. I didn\u2019t see Eve at all this round. No one else was in storage when I found the body. Since Alice was last seen by me near lower engine, the kill likely happened sometime after tick 12, possibly after she moved into storage."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340917.936954, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I went security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> oxygen and I\u2019m in oxygen now. I didn\u2019t see Alice, Bob, Diana, or Eve this round. The only person I have info on is Frank \u2014 I saw him in/around medbay early, ticks 3-5.\n\nFrank\u2019s report makes sense route-wise, but I can\u2019t confirm anything after that. Since he says Alice was alive lower engine around tick 12 and body was in storage, the killer likely had access to lower engine/storage after that. Eve being unseen the whole round is notable, but I want to hear her route before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340951.9853928, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019m in lower engine right now. My route was medbay -> storage -> navigation -> back through storage -> lower engine. I was mostly on the bottom/right side, which is probably why nobody saw me.\n\nImportant: I saw Alice alive in storage pretty late, around tick 21, when I passed through. I left toward lower engine and there was no body when I left. So if Frank is reporting Alice in storage now, that kill had to happen after I left.\n\nCharlie being in oxygen makes it really hard for him to get to storage in that window. Frank\u2019s route literally ends lower engine -> storage, and he\u2019s the one reporting. This feels like either Frank walked in right after me and killed/reported, or it\u2019s a self-report. I\u2019m leaning Frank here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340972.554154, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Eve\u2019s story is exactly why I think it\u2019s her. I came lower engine -> storage and reported the moment I saw Alice\u2019s body. I never saw Eve at all, including in lower engine/storage, and I definitely didn\u2019t see Alice alive in storage late \u2014 last time I saw Alice alive was lower engine around tick 12.\n\nCharlie being in oxygen is far from storage for this timing. Eve claims she was storage -> lower engine right before the report, and the body is in storage. That puts her right on the kill path with the latest claimed contact on Alice. This looks like Eve killed Alice in or near storage, moved to lower engine, then blamed the reporter. I\u2019m voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341027.963817, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "From my POV this is between Eve and Frank, and we cannot skip at final 3.\n\nMy hard info is limited: I only saw Frank early in medbay ticks 3-5, then I went security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> oxygen and stayed far from storage. I never saw Eve at all.\n\nThe key contradiction is Eve says she saw Alice alive in storage around tick 21, then left to lower engine. Frank says he came lower engine -> storage and reported Alice, and he never saw Eve. That puts Eve directly on the body path right before the report by her own story, but Frank also has self-report possibility.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Eve because she was unseen all round, admits being in storage late with Alice alive, and then was in lower engine right next to storage. Frank reporting could be self-report, but Eve\u2019s claimed timing feels like it\u2019s built to frame the reporter."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341057.764621, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Charlie, listen: if I were the killer here, I would not volunteer \u201cI saw Alice alive in storage at tick 21.\u201d I could\u2019ve just said I was lower engine doing fuel and never saw her. I gave the late timing because it\u2019s true, and it proves the kill happened after I left storage.\n\nFrank\u2019s story is convenient: he says he came lower engine -> storage and instantly found the body, but that is exactly the route that lets him kill Alice in storage and self-report. He also \u201cnever saw me,\u201d which doesn\u2019t clear him \u2014 I was already in lower engine when the meeting got called.\n\nYou are basically hard-cleared by location, Charlie. This is between me and Frank. Frank reported the body, had the route to storage, and is trying to turn my truthful late info against me.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank."}}
